  "title": "Panchayats Develop EV Infrastructure Amid Rural Challenges",
  "summary": "Panchayats are expanding EV charging and battery swapping facilities on Panchayat-owned land, aiming to boost clean mobility and create recurring revenue opportunities for rural local bodies. The Ministry of Panchayati Raj has signed an MoU with CESL to support this initiative.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Panchayats are to develop EV charging and battery-swapping facilities on Panchayat-owned land, expanding clean mobility beyond cities.",
