      "title": "Discoms not cooperative enough on EV charging infra: Advisor to PM",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/industry/auto/discoms-not-cooperative-on-ev-charging-infra-says-pm-adviser-tarun-kapoor-126112000991_1.html",
      "description": "PM adviser Tarun Kapoor calls for nodal officers at discoms to resolve EV charging issues, flags high connection costs and low utilisation of public charging stations",
